ps://decrypt.co/?p=366405</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/tilly-norwood-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/tilly-norwood-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenClaw Put Apple Back in the AI Game—And Now They Can&#39;t Build Macs Fast Enough</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366389/openclaw-apple-mac-mini-shortage-ai-2026</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 13:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Mac mini went from a $599 desktop nobody cared about to the hottest piece of AI hardware on the planet. One open-source agent framework did it.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366389</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/apple-logo-decrypy-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Minnesota Moves to Ban AI Apps That Generate Fake Nude Images</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366388/minnesota-moves-ban-ai-apps-generate-fake-nude-images</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 21:16:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The bill, which bans AI tools that generate fake nudity and lets victims sue their creators, will go to Governor Walz for his signature.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366388</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-18-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-18-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ethereum Foundation Sells $23 Million More in ETH to Tom Lee&#39;s BitMine</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366385/ethereum-foundation-sells-23-million-more-eth-tom-lee-bitmine</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 18:55:21 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>For the second straight week, the Ethereum Foundation has unloaded 10,000 ETH—about $23 million worth—to top treasury firm, BitMine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366385</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-06-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-06-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Doctors Use AI to Spot &#39;Hidden&#39; Sperm In Men</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366374/doctors-ai-hidden-sperm-men-study</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 18:39:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Columbia University Fertility Center&#39;s Star method uses artificial intelligence to detect rare sperm missed in standard tests.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366374</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/doctor-decrypt-style-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI&#39;s GPT-5.5 Matches Claude Mythos in Cyberattack Capabilities: AI Security Institute</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366371/openais-gpt-55-matches-claude-mythos-cyberattack-ai-security-institute</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 17:56:55 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI&#39;s GPT-5.5 is the second AI system to complete a simulated corporate network intrusion end-to-end, raising alarms.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366371</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/crypto-crime-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"998\" width=\"1775\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Pentagon Signs AI Deals With Google, OpenAI, Nvidia, Microsoft, Amazon and SpaceX</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366351/pentagon-ai-deals-google-openai-nvidia-microsoft-amazon-spacex</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 17:22:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Department of Defense&#39;s agreements will enable AI from the likes of Google and OpenAI to run on top-secret military networks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366351</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-pete-hegseth-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-pete-hegseth-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Riot Platforms Stock Pops as Bitcoin Miner Reports Data Center Revenue, Doubled AMD Deal</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366347/riot-stock-pops-bitcoin-miner-data-center-revenue-doubled-amd-deal</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 16:10:35 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Bitcoin mining company&#39;s pivot to AI infrastructure hosting generated its first data center revenue as AMD expanded its capacity.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366347</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ethereum ETFs Shed $184M Over 4-Day Negative Streak</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366343/ethereum-etfs-shed-184m-over-4-day-negative-streak</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 15:47:39 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Outflows from Ethereum ETFs extended to a 4-day streak as Bitcoin funds shed $490 million, even as the S&amp;#038;P 500 hit an all-time high.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366343</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-08-scaled-gID_7.jpeg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-08-scaled-gID_7.jpeg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>MoonPay Launches Debit Mastercard That Lets AI Agents Pay With Stablecoins</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366341/moonpay-launches-debit-mastercard-ai-agents-pay-stablecoins</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 15:16:44 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>MoonPay’s new debit Mastercard lets autonomous AI agents spend stablecoins at any online Mastercard merchant.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366341</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/